      --as as-value                  REQUIRED — what the source ACTUALLY DID for the claim. It has a negative half: refutes and absent are findings, not failures to grade. Absent is refused on a copy fetch recorded as the work's abstract, or as not the work
      --confidence high|medium|low   REQUIRED — how sure you are of THAT determination, whichever it was. A separate question from --as: a refutation you would defend and one you are unsure of are different facts
  -h, --help                         help for verify
