      --quote string                 REQUIRED — the EXACT report text, verbatim and NOTHING else — no section heading, dash or pipe: the whole string is matched against the report, so anything prepended matches nothing. Name the section in --reason, where prose belongs (the claim you are checking)
      --reason string                REQUIRED — your THINKING for this act, not your process — why you graded, closed, ruled or edited as you did; it is the substance the other side answers. The record already holds WHAT you did, in order, so do not narrate the verbs you ran

